      ## /) files used to configure
      ## [Static Assets](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/).
      ## `_headers` and `_redirects` files should be
      ## included as modules named `_headers` and `_redirects` with content type
      ## `text/plain`.
      ##
    number*: int64
      ## The integer version number, starting from one.
    package_dependencies*: Option[seq[JsonNode]]
      ## The list of npm packages that were installed and used when this Worker
      ## version was built.
      ##
    placement*: Option[WorkersPlacementInfoNoStatus]
